# Run output directories (root-anchored: a leading slash keeps these to the repo
# root so they do NOT also match the source package tessera/data/, which must be
# tracked). The six processed daily-bar CSVs in /data/ are committed so a fresh
# clone can run immediately; /runs/ output stays local.
# (Stooq_csv/ holds the raw downloaded source CSVs, kept local.)
/runs/
/Stooq_csv/

